---
title: "JRN-001 Happy Path — Personal Current Account Opening"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor PER001 as PER-001<br/>Personal Customer
    participant SVC017 as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant SVC001 as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant SVC050 as SVC-050<br/>Customer Onboarding
    participant SVC051 as SVC-051<br/>Sanctions Screening
    participant SVC014 as SVC-014<br/>KYC/AML Service
    participant SVC100 as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant EB as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053<br/>Notifications

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PER001,SVC001: PH-001 — Application Initiation
        PER001->>SVC017: Submit application form<br/>(name, DOB, address, nationality, account type)
        SVC017->>SVC001: POST /applications
        SVC001->>EB: publish ApplicationStarted<br/>{ application_id, customer_id, channel, started_at }
        SVC001-->>SVC017: 201 Created { application_id, application_ref, status: in_progress }
        SVC017-->>PER001: Confirmation screen + application reference
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over PER001,SVC050: PH-002 — Identity Verification
        SVC017->>SVC050: POST /identity-verifications<br/>{ application_id, document_type: passport, customer_name, DOB, address }
        SVC050-->>SVC017: 201 Created { verification_id, vendor_sdk_token }
        SVC017-->>PER001: Display Onfido SDK (document capture + liveness check)
        PER001->>SVC050: Onfido SDK completes — vendor webhook<br/>{ outcome: pass, biometric_match_score: 0.96, address_verification: confirmed }
        Note over SVC050: Persists IdentityVerification (ENT-002)<br/>Biometric template NOT stored — outcome only (UK GDPR Art.9)
        SVC050->>EB: publish IdentityVerificationCompleted<br/>{ verification_id, customer_id, document_type: passport, outcome: PASS }
        SVC017-->>PER001: In-app: "Identity confirmed — background checks in progress"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over SVC014,SVC051: PH-003 — KYC/CDD Assessment
        SVC014->>SVC051: POST /sanctions/screen<br/>{ first_name, last_name, DOB, nationality: [GB], lists: [OFSI, OFAC, UN, EU] }
        Note over SVC051: Hard SLA: <3,000ms (GOV-005-R02)
        SVC051-->>SVC014: 200 OK { status: CLEAR, processing_time_ms: 312 }
        Note over SVC014: PEP screening — ComplyAdvantage: CLEAR<br/>Adverse media screening: CLEAR<br/>Risk scoring: 22/100 → risk_category: simplified
        SVC014->>EB: publish KYCClearanceGranted<br/>{ assessment_id, customer_id, risk_category: simplified, next_review_date: +5yr }
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over SVC001: PH-004 — Account Decision
        Note over SVC001: Decision engine: identity PASS + KYC CLEAR<br/>+ risk simplified + age 18+ + UK resident → APPROVED
        SVC001->>EB: publish ApplicationDecisionMade<br/>{ application_id, customer_id, decision_outcome: APPROVED, decided_at }
        SVC053-->>PER001: In-app + Email: "Application approved — setting up your account"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over SVC001: PH-005 — Account Provisioning
        Note over SVC001: Create Account (ENT-004): sort_code: 40-47-84<br/>account_number: 87654321, balance: £0.00<br/>FSCS SCV updated, CASS registration initiated
        SVC001->>EB: publish AccountOpened<br/>{ account_id, customer_id, sort_code, account_number, iban, fscs_eligible: true }
        SVC001->>EB: publish AccountProvisioned<br/>{ account_id, customer_id, status: active, cass_registered: false, provisioned_at }
        SVC001->>EB: publish CardIssuanceTriggered<br/>{ card_id, account_id, card_type: debit, delivery_address }
        Note over SVC001: PCI DSS: no PAN or CVV2 in event payload<br/>Card delivery: 3–5 working days
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 245)
        Note over PER001,SVC100: PH-006 — Digital Channel Activation
        PER001->>SVC017: Set up credentials (username + password)
        SVC017->>SVC100: Create credentials + register FIDO2/WebAuthn device<br/>{ customer_id, hashed_password, fido2_credential_id, device_id }
        Note over SVC100: Biometric assertion only — template stays on device<br/>(FIDO2/WebAuthn + UK GDPR data minimisation)
        PER001->>SVC017: First login — SCA (Face ID + registered device)
        SVC017->>SVC100: Verify SCA (FIDO2 assertion)
        SVC100-->>SVC017: SCA confirmed
        SVC017->>EB: publish DigitalChannelActivated<br/>{ customer_id, account_id, sca_enrolled: true, activated_at }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 220)
        Note over PER001,SVC053: PH-007 — Welcome and Onboarding
        SVC053-->>PER001: Welcome email: account details, sort code, FSCS info sheet
        SVC053-->>PER001: In-app: initial funding prompt + CASS switching option<br/>+ vulnerability wellbeing questions (FCA FG21/1)
        SVC001->>EB: publish WelcomePackDispatched<br/>{ customer_id, account_id, dispatched_at }
        Note over PER001: Journey complete — customer is active account holder<br/>Total elapsed: <10 minutes (automated path)
    end
